[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2028009573","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2424#issuecomment-2028009573","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2424","id":2028009573,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE8544Phl","user":{"login":"karsten-klein","id":20038021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDM4MDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20038021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein","html_url":"https://github.com/karsten-klein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-03-30T10:45:33Z","updated_at":"2024-03-30T10:45:33Z","body":"**{metæffekt} Universe**\r\ncanonical name: [X11 License](https://github.com/org-metaeffekt/metaeffekt-universe/blob/main/src/main/resources/ae-universe/[x]/README.md#user-content-X11-License:~:text=X11%20License)\r\nmarkers: Do Not Promote Marker, No Warranty Marker\r\ncategory: X11\r\nSPDX reference id: [X11](https://spdx.org/licenses/X11.html)\r\nScanCode reference id: [x11-xconsortium](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/x11-xconsortium.LICENSE)\r\nOpen CoDE status: approved\r\nOpen CoDE approved id: X11 (SPDX)\r\n\r\n**ScanCode**\r\nmatched id: [x11-xconsortium](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/x11-xconsortium.LICENSE)\r\n\r\n**Comment**\r\nI regard that the variation in the clause \"Except as contained...\" does not mandate another license template. So +1 in adjusting the X11 xml to match X11 in this case. This would than also match the ScanCode and {metæffekt} Universe interpretation of the given license text.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2028009573/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2077730138","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2424#issuecomment-2077730138","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2424","id":2077730138,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85716Va","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-04-25T16:46:45Z","updated_at":"2024-04-25T16:46:45Z","body":"Discussed on 2024-04-25 legal team call, generally agreed that it would be ideal to handle these as part of the X11 license if markup can accommodate it; but not sure technically whether regexes in XML can actually handle swapping the order of the two paragraphs. If can't handle, then probably add as a separate license.\r\n\r\nThat said, existing matching guidelines at https://spdx.github.io/spdx-spec/v2.3/license-matching-guidelines-and-templates/#b32-guideline-verbatim-text say that differently ordered paragraphs should be treated as not matching:\r\n\r\n```\r\nB.3.2 Guideline: verbatim text\r\n\r\nLicense and exception text should be the same verbatim text (except for the guidelines stated here). The text should be in the same order, e.g., differently ordered paragraphs would not be considered a match.\r\n```\r\n\r\nGiven that, unless we're revisiting B.3.2, probably we should add this as a separate license ID.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2077730138/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2078693935","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2424#issuecomment-2078693935","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2424","id":2078693935,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE8575lov","user":{"login":"xsuchy","id":85769,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NzY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85769?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy","html_url":"https://github.com/xsuchy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/gists{/gist_id}","sta